Breaks: the server's store takes PostgreSQL for a backend that does not partition its journal, so it never extends
the partitions V4 made: the journal has no months ahead. It replaces store-skips-postgresql-steps, whose break (the
shared steps only) no longer lets the server start, since a PostgreSQL step adds columns it reads (backlog 228).
Module: catalog-server
Test: SchemaAtStartupTest

